Notebook[{Cell["DefineOmega", "ObjectName"], Cell["DefineOmega specifies \
whether the definition of omega_a^b is included once when used.", "Usage"], 
  Cell["Status: Alpha.", "Notes"], 
  Cell["Option for the view producers and renderers. Default: True.", 
   "Notes"], Cell["True includes the definition omega_a^b = e^{2 pi i b/a} \
once in the legend when omega notation is used; False leaves it to the \
caller.", "Notes"], 
  Cell[
